# MQTT access list of the local-cloud broker. The sysMonitor observations of all systems use the AMQP broker
# (amqp/acl); this broker carries SysMonitor's sysMonitorData output and the other intra-cloud MQTT traffic.
# Users are full certificate subjects (use_subject_as_username, RFC 2253 order) of system (sy) certificates (M1).

user dnQualifier=sy,CN=SysMonitor.TestCloud.Company.arrowhead.eu,OU=Arrowhead Systems,O=Company,C=SE
topic write arrowhead/TestCloud/health/mqtt
topic write arrowhead/TestCloud/sysmonitor/data/+/+

user dnQualifier=sy,CN=AIGym.TestCloud.Company.arrowhead.eu,OU=Arrowhead Systems,O=Company,C=SE
topic read arrowhead/TestCloud/sysmonitor/data/+/+
